# Maintainer: Moritz Meißelbach <4208996+Biont@users.noreply.github.com>
# Alpine 3.24's main/mesa (aports b94e73658216f4e91c701bfdeb420e6874910a74) with the
# GlassineOS freedreno patches for the Adreno 509 (glassine-*.patch). Same package names
# as Alpine's, so it upgrades the stock Mesa. Only freedreno and llvmpipe are built; the
# subpackages of drivers not built stay as empty packages, so installed ones upgrade too.
# Alpine's recipe:
# Contributor: David Heidelberg <david@ixit.cz>
maintainer="team/alpine-desktop <achill@achill.org>"
